Subject: [PATCH] Save the shared library back down to a folder
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The source picker gains "Save "<folder>" to a folder…" and "Save the
whole library to a folder…" in shared-library mode. Each song is written as
a .cho file under its library folder's path, named after the file it came
from, with a preview and diff before anything is written. Nothing on disk
is deleted, and copying the folder back in finds every song in place.

